#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid "You can modify the Weathermap Node from here.  The Position columns are the X,Y position on the Map.  The Internal Name is the unique ID given to the Node.  The Label is the external name of the Node that you provide to users.  The Icon Filename is the Graphic that you want to represent the Node Object.  The INFO URL is a link that you can provide when clicking on the active Map Node.  The Hover Graph URL's are Cacti or other Graphs URL's that can will appear when hovering over the Node.  The Graph Selector is a helper for selecting Cacti Graphs for the Graph URL's.   There are several other Node properties possible.  However, today we are only supporting those included above."
msgstr "Za ka iya gyara Kullin Weathermap daga nan.  Ginshiƙan Wuri sune matsayin X,Y a kan Taswira.  Sunan Ciki shine ID na musamman da aka bai wa Kullin.  Lakabi shine sunan waje na Kullin da kake bai wa masu amfani.  Sunan Fayil ɗin Alama shine Hoton da kake son ya wakilci Abin Kulli.  INFO URL shine hanyar haɗi da za ka iya bayarwa lokacin danna Kullin Taswira mai aiki.  Hover Graph URLs sune URLs na Jadawalan Cacti ko wasu da za su bayyana yayin tsayawa a kan Kullin.  Mai Zaɓin Jadawali mai taimako ne don zaɓar Jadawalan Cacti don URLs na Jadawali.   Akwai wasu kadarorin Kulli da yawa da ke yiwuwa.  Duk da haka, a yau muna tallafawa waɗanda aka haɗa a sama ne kawai."

