#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Ƙarfin Hanyar Bayanai (Bandwidth):</strong> Saita ƙarfin da ake amfani da shi don ƙididdige amfani, misali 100M ko 1G. Ana tallafawa K, M, G da T. Zaɓi Daidai Da &quot;Shiga&quot; idan duka kwatance biyu suna da ƙarfi iri ɗaya.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tashar haɗi ta zirga-zirga:</strong> Bincika ta na'ura, tasha ko bayani, ko zaɓi Bincika duka. Zaɓi tashar haɗi, sannan ka danna Yi amfani da tashar haɗi don saita babban tushen da aka auna, wurin danna da babban jadawalin nuni yayin tsayawa. Ana riƙe ƙarin tusoshin da aka auna da jadawalan nuni yayin tsayawa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Kamanni da sharhi:</strong> Salon Biya (Via Style) yana sarrafa lanƙwasassu ko masu kusurwa; Faɗin Haɗi yana sarrafa kaurin kibiya. Sharhin SHIGA da Sharhin FITA suna ƙara rubutu a gefen kowace hanya. Kashi cikin ɗari yana saita wurin rubutun a kan haɗin. Salon Sharhi yana sanya sharhi a gefen haɗin (Gefe) ko a saman kibiya (Tsakiya); Yi amfani da asalin taswira yana bin Salon Taswira.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ƙarin jadawalan nuni yayin tsayawa:</strong> Nuna mafi yawan jadawalan nuni yayin tsayawa biyu: babban jadawalin zirga-zirga da ƙari guda ɗaya, kamar CPU, jinkiri ko wata tashar haɗi. Tace ta nau'in jadawali yana taƙaita zaɓukan. Ƙara jadawalin nuni yayin tsayawa yana ƙara ƙarin; Maye gurbin jadawalan nuni yayin tsayawa yana sauya shi; Cire jadawali yana cire shi. Babban jadawalin zirga-zirga, zirga-zirgar da aka auna da wurin danna na haɗi suna nan ba tare da sauyi ba. A cikin mai kallo, kowane samfoti na Cacti yana buɗe nasa cikakken jadawali idan aka danna shi.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Saituna masu zurfi:</strong> Abubuwan sarrafawa na zaɓi don matsar da lakabin zirga-zirga na SHIGA/FITA, haɗa tusoshin da aka auna, sauya wurin danna da shigar da URLs na hoton nuni yayin tsayawa na musamman. Wuraren lakabin zirga-zirga suna matsar da akwatunan amfani a kan haɗin, daban da wuraren sharhi. Yi amfani da asalin taswira yana bin Salon Taswira. Haɗin zirga-zirga na yau da kullum yawanci ba ya buƙatar sauyi a nan.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Haɗa tusoshin zirga-zirga:</strong> Ƙara tushen zirga-zirga yana ƙara wata tashar haɗi zuwa jimillar taswira, daban don SHIGA da FITA. Cire tushe yana cire ƙarin tushe. Sauya babban tushen ta amfani da Yi amfani da tashar haɗi a sama. Ana kwatanta haɗaɗɗiyar zirga-zirgar da ƙarfin hanyar bayanai da aka saita don ƙididdige amfani. Ba a ƙirƙirar haɗaɗɗen jadawalin Cacti ta kai tsaye; ƙirƙiri jadawalin haɗaka da ya dace a cikin Cacti kuma shigar da URLs ɗinsa na danna da nuni yayin tsayawa idan ana buƙata. Haɗe-haɗen taswira daban-daban yawanci sun fi bayyana don babban haɗi da na madadi.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tusoshi da URLs na hannu:</strong> Akwatin rubutun tushe yana gyara cikakken jerin tusoshin da aka auna, har da babban tushe. URL na wurin danna yana sarrafa inda danna haɗin taswira ke kaiwa. Babban URL na jadawalin nuni yayin tsayawa yana saita samfoti na farko; URL(s) na ƙarin jadawali yana karɓar ƙarin URL na hoto guda ɗaya. Ana kuma sarrafa wannan ƙarin ƙarƙashin Ƙarin jadawalan nuni yayin tsayawa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tsara da Biya (Tidy da Via):</strong> Tsara yana daidaita fasalin haɗin. Ta Hanyar (Via) yana ba ka damar sanya wurin lanƙwasa a kan taswirar.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Gyara Saita ta Asali:</strong> Gyara rubutun saitin taswira na asali don saituna fiye da wannan fom.</p>"

